@startuml prompt-cache-demo
title Prompt Caching: Init then Reuse (high level)

actor Developer as dev
participant "Your App" as app
participant "Instant Model" as model

dev -> app : Run cache demo

== Cache init (first call) ==
app -> app : Build one large stable prompt\n+ a cache key
app -> model : Send prompt with cache key
note right of model
  Cache MISS
  Store the stable prefix
end note
model --> app : Answer\n(full input billed at standard rate)

== Reuse (second call) ==
app -> model : Send same prompt with same cache key
note right of model
  Cache HIT
  Reuse the stored prefix
end note
model --> app : Answer\n(stable prefix billed as cheaper cached input)

app --> dev : Show token usage + savings

@enduml
